OL,3,GNEWSAWoman bailed as baby death inquiry
OL,4,Acontinues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,7,Fafter the death of a baby girl has been
OL,8,Fbailed and detained in hospital under
OL,9,Fthe Mental Health Act for psychological
OL,10,Fassessment, police have said.
OL,12,FOfficers were called to a property at
OL,13,FOxford Way, Cambourne, at about 07:40
OL,14,FBST on 10 October to reports of concern
OL,15,Ffor a woman and baby.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Police said both were
OL,18,Ftaken to Addenbrooke's Hospital in
OL,19,FCambridge, but the baby was declared
OL,20,Fdead shortly after arrival.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
